>
> I'll keep it in mind. Now a stupid question: I guess you mean that a
> chest should be left somewhere where I remember. You don't mean to put
> things in a chest and then to carry a chest?

The idea is chests are heavy so few monsters pick them up, and no or
almost no monster ever opens a chest.  Carry the empty chest to close to
the down stairs.  Shuttle the more important of your items to put into
the chest.  Keep stashes of the less useful items near the down stairs
of most levels.  Shuttle the most important items down with you as you
go.  How much to shuttle?  If it takes more than a few trips time to
trim more mercilessly.


